OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 22 FEB
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GTo mark the 400th anniversary of
OL,6,     GJohn Dowland's death, Sara Mohr-
OL,7,     GPietsch traces a path towards
OL,8,     GJohn Dowland's famous Lachrimae
OL,9,     Gcollection.
OL,10,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GLive from the Chapel of Merton
OL,12,     GCollege, Oxford on Ash Wednesday,
OL,13,     Gwith music by MacMillan, Byrd and
OL,14,     GTallis.
OL,15,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,16,     GAlyn's record box has new
OL,17,     Greleases from Tim Garland &
OL,18,     GGeoffrey Keezer, Norma Winstone
OL,19,     Gand Alex Wilson plus classic cuts
OL,20,     Gfrom Duke Ellington, Bill Evans,
OL,21,     GLee Morgan and more.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
