OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 22 FEB
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GTo mark the 400th anniversary of
OL,6,     GJohn Dowland's death, Hannah
OL,7,     GFrench explores the years the
OL,8,     Gcomposer spent working in the
OL,9,     Gcourt of King Christian IV of
OL,10,     GDenmark.
OL,11,G1800FWords and Music
OL,12,     GBe careful what you wish for:
OL,13,     Gsome wishes go badly wrong,
OL,14,     Gothers bring joy. We look at both
OL,15,     Gkinds of wish, from the Monkey's
OL,16,     GPaw to Edward Lear's riotous poem
OL,17,     Gabout nutcrackers.
OL,18,G1915FBetween the Ears: Words First
OL,19,     Fmeets Sound First
OL,20,     GEmerging spoken word poets and
OL,21,     Gsound designers collaborate on
OL,22,     Gthe theme of 'time'.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
